{"id": "34467", "title": "叛逆风骚", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34467.htm", "intro": "他这个灾星到哪去都没人敢收留，因为怕害得自己全家死光光，偏偏有人不信邪让他住下，这娇滴滴的小姑娘「据说」是他姨婆，可是除了泡茶之外啥都不懂，还说会好好照顾他，真是天晓得！这下叛逆少年只好变身超级保母，锇了他下厨，病了他当看护，她脚动不了，更得劳他背着走路，人家是两小无猜，却被棒打鸳鸯，这一分离，让他仇恨心又起，成为黑帮跨国集团大哥，还誓言要毁灭老家「日光城」……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34467", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2187403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2187404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2187425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2187426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2187427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页